# EsyDuckDB / API Hub

CCC analytics PostgreSQL is available **only** through the hub — never direct DB connections.

- Query endpoint: `POST /newapi/hub/esyduckdb/db/query` (deploy + local; Vite proxies `/newapi`)
- Absolute hub URL: `https://cccdev.esyasoft.app/newapi/hub/esyduckdb/db/query`
- Body: `{ "sql": "<one SELECT or WITH…SELECT>", "limit": 100 }` — read-only, one statement, no `;`
- Do **not** invent per-report REST APIs; always raw SQL through this endpoint
- Migrate wall screens **one source/KPI at a time** as the user specifies; do not invent field mappings

When exploring data or wiring screens, follow `.cursor/skills/esyduckdb-api-hub/SKILL.md`.
